      "id": "sol.amc-8-2001-p10.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Four state quarters have face value \\(\\$1\\).\n\nSince \\(2000\\%=20\\), the collector pays \\(20\\) times face value, or \\(\\$20\\).\n\nThus, A is the correct answer.",
